; ─── THE WARDEN'S ARENA ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
;
; Built so each of the boss's three phases has the thing it needs, and nothing
; here is decoration:
;
;   PILLARS      five, plus the outer walls. Phase one is dodging so the boss
;                charges into one, so the arena IS the weapon.
;   POUND DECK   at y=8, with stairs. slam_power() is fall/12, so a drop from
;                the deck is 0.67 against a `crack_power` of 0.5, while a
;                standing hop is 0.21. The deck is the accessible route into
;                phase two; a clean triple jump is the show-off route.
;   A PILLAR AT  x=-18, hard against the deck's edge. Luring the boss to crash
;   THE DECK     there is what lets you already be high up when it stuns.
;   KEGS         phase three is a race for the seed, and a thrown keg is how
;                you buy a head start.
;   SOCKET       at the far end, with the platform and exit above it. The boss
;                is beaten by DELIVERY, so the trip to the socket is the last
;                phase of the fight rather than a victory lap.
[node name="WardenArena" type="Node3D"]

